PRIVACY POLICY

Overview
The project's website collects no actual data, cookies, or any sort of analytics. Its only purpose is to give you a download and basic information about the client's package.

Exception
Except for Vercel's activity statistics, which do not collect any of your data. They only track server load and traffic.

What we do not collect
No cookies, no client-side analytics, no browser fingerprinting, no tracking pixels, no accounts, no forms, no newsletter signups, no advertising networks.

Server-level statistics
The site is hosted on Vercel. Vercel records aggregate infrastructure metrics such as request counts, bandwidth usage, and server load. These metrics are used only to keep the service operational and are never used to identify, profile, or track individual visitors.

Downloaded files
The APK is served as a static asset. Downloading it does not create a record tied to you on our end. Once installed, the application may handle data according to its own behavior, which is outside the scope of this website's privacy policy.

Third parties
No third-party scripts, fonts, embeds, or trackers are loaded by this website. The only external dependency is the hosting provider described above.

Children's privacy
This website does not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children under the age of 13, because it does not collect personal information at all.

Changes to this policy
If this policy is updated, the revised version will be published on this page with a new last-updated date. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.

Contact
Questions about this policy can be directed to the project maintainers through the contact channel listed on the main project page.

